OL,3,S#######################################
OL,4,CCalls for Marilyn Manson performance   
OL,5,Cto be pulled                           
OL,6,GA Brent councillor has joined calls to 
OL,7,Gprevent Marilyn Manson performing at   
OL,8,GWembley Stadium next year ahead of a   
OL,9,Gtrial the singer faces over sexual     
OL,10,Gassault allegations.                   
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat Anton Georgiou has    
OL,13,Fgathered more than 20,000 signatures   
OL,14,Fon a petition urging the venue to take 
OL,15,F"a firm stand" against Manson, who is  
OL,16,Fdue to support Slipknot there in July. 
